  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, add the water (for the rice) and bring to the boil.\n• Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ac1af966d483a14eecdae4-6c57f3c2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. Grate carrot. Roughly chop tomato. Drain sweetcorn. Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook carrot, corn and black beans until slightly tender, 3-4 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ac1af966d483a14eecdae4-196d67e8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add tomato paste, BBQ spice blend and tomato to beans, and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the water (for the sauce) and stock powder. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove from heat, then add baby spinach and cooked rice, gently stirring to combine. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ac1af966d483a14eecdae4-4c0667c5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• Transfer rice mixture to baking dish. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Grill until lightly golden, 5-8 mins.\n• Divide cheesy black bean and veggie rice between bowls.\n• Serve with sour cream.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ac1af966d483a14eecdae4-2214487b.jpeg"
    }
  ]
